OL,3,GNEWSATwo men banned from every football
OL,4,Aground in UK after Old Firm disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been banned from every
OL,7,Ffootball ground in the UK for five
OL,8,Fyears for participating in disorder at
OL,9,Fan Old Firm game.
OL,11,FThe Rangers fans were separately
OL,12,Fcaptured on video participating in the
OL,13,Fchaotic scenes which tainted the
OL,14,FScottish Cup Quarter Final in March.
OL,16,FFootage showed Mackenzie Graham, 21,
OL,17,Ffrom Glasgow, jumping over a fence and
OL,18,Fleading a group invading the pitch. He
OL,19,Frepeatedly incited others to do the
OL,20,Fsame.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
